<title>DUBAI: OPEC monitoring committee to meet in Iran in March.</title>
<headline>OPEC monitoring committee to meet in Iran in March.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC's monitoring committee is set to meet in Iran in March, OPEC Secretary-General Rilwanu Lukman was on Tuesday quoted as saying.</p>
<p>Lukman, in an interview with the London-based Arabic-language al-Hayat newspaper, did not say when in March the committee would meet.</p>
<p>&quot;Iran heads the committee currently and Nigeria and Indonesia are members...They will meet in Tehran next month to look at production figures that the general secretariat receives and the market situation,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
